# Platform Event Thinking

## Real-Life Example: Student Registration System

When a student registers for a course:

- The student receives a confirmation email automatically
- The admin dashboard updates the student count
- The finance system generates the fee payment record
- The course instructor gets notified about the new student

One action triggers notifications and updates across multiple systems automatically.

